Package: biblio
Type: Package
Title: Convert RefWorks Citations to BibTeX
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mario", "Martinez", email = "mario.a.martinez@live.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts citations exported from RefWorks in Tagged Format into
    BibTeX (.bib) entries. The conversion is implemented in C++ via Rcpp.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: 
    Rcpp,
    writexl
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: 
    readxl,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
URL: https://github.com/cownr10r/biblio
BugReports: https://github.com/cownr10r/biblio/issues
